d strong. The atmosphere is a bit austere; I felt it could be brighter. They have amazing local artists displaying for sale. I recommend you check it out, you never know what will tickle your fancy. But that ramen tho? Ooooh yes. On Fridays they have oyster ramen. As the weather gets warmer the plan is to host various pop-up restaurants to provide variety. They also have some entertainment in the works. This will be a great place for tourists and those who live downtown to check out. I ABSOLUTELY plan to visit again and soon. They do take plastic. Be aware that beca..."},{"business_id":"73xAuGWkv7O9eZMlRMrN3A","review_id":"vczMgQOYxq78dNpYRcXnCQ","date":"2020-10-30T17:35:15","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8704389333724976,"text_excerpt":"Dive bar in a nice part of town. Cold beers, stiff drinks, and friendly bartenders. It's the perfect combo."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"73xAuGWkv7O9eZMlRMrN3A","photo_id":"VaSjJti_jAHArSusb_L2Cw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/VaSjJti_jAHArSusb_L2Cw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8853998780250549},{"business_id":"73xAuGWkv7O9eZMlRMrN3A","photo_id":"hl7er9Adq0-aZimpqVei3w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/hl7er9Adq0-aZimpqVei3w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8727108240127563},{"business_id":"73xAuGWkv7O9eZMlRMrN3A","photo_id":"tEiRPKKTF_AZ9_gv47OSmA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/tEiRPKKTF_AZ9_gv47OSmA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8478320240974426}]},"notebook_case":null}
